                    {
                        "sense_id": "8ba8befe-991b-354e-9343-d8b0d89ce4fe",
                        "entry_id": "6d2e2613-bcdf-39db-8e14-ddd90be2b230",
                        "glosses": [
                            "With sips."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "2cf1f11d-eedc-4eab-b12c-1414f887feb8",
                                "sense_id": "8ba8befe-991b-354e-9343-d8b0d89ce4fe",
                                "text": "Because there is nothing sottish about you; and you throw down your wine like a man that wants to get a certain quantity down in order to drown care, and not like one who drinks it because he likes the taste of it,—that is, slowly and sippingly."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b6da3f22-ec44-4115-9ee0-7ab4a6656680",
                                "sense_id": "8ba8befe-991b-354e-9343-d8b0d89ce4fe",
                                "text": "I have long observed, as I doubt not have many of you, that the condition here described is often alleviated in the most striking manner by the use of exclusively liquid nourishment—such as milk or milk-gruel, given in small portions sub-continuously, or sippingly, as it were, throughout the waking hours—the patient being never permitted to take a distinct meal, nor a particle of solid food."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c8149115-2417-4934-8622-009ea0ee4842",
                                "sense_id": "8ba8befe-991b-354e-9343-d8b0d89ce4fe",
                                "text": "He might ignore it for three months and then, one midnight, drink sippingly and methodically from a water glass, lying back on the cot an hour later with the world all closed down, nothing left of it but a terminal throbbing ache in his forebrain."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
